--[[
	TowerAPI
	All-in-one Tower Defense API

	Features:
		• Place towers
		• Upgrade towers
		• Sell towers
		• Use abilities
		• Get cash
		• Change target (adapter placeholder)
		• Skip
		• Restart
		• Vote
		• Get lobby/player data
		• Get maps
		• Get modifiers
		• Elevator setup
		• Dialogue listener
		• Record actions
		• Replay actions
		• Condition-based replay
		• JSON replay export/import
		• Teleport replay queue
		• Error reporting
		• Status/debug information

	Replay format:
		{
			Format = "TowerReplay",
			Version = 1,
			Actions = {...}
		}
]]

